=== A. S&P 500 addition screen as of an evaluation date (eligible != added) ===
evaluation 2025-06-02: minimum total cap 20.5 bn, minimum FMC 10.25 bn
  P (passes all)           -> eligible
  Q (cap 21.0 bn)          -> eligible
  R (latest quarter loss)  -> fails: latest quarter GAAP NI <= 0
  S (IPO 10 months ago)    -> fails: traded < 12 months
  T (IWF 0.08)             -> fails: FMC 2.0 < 10.25; IWF < 0.10
evaluation 2025-07-15: minimum total cap 22.7 bn, minimum FMC 11.35 bn
  P (passes all)           -> eligible
  Q (cap 21.0 bn)          -> fails: total cap 21.0 < 22.7
  R (latest quarter loss)  -> fails: latest quarter GAAP NI <= 0
  S (IPO 10 months ago)    -> fails: traded < 12 months
  T (IWF 0.08)             -> fails: FMC 2.0 < 11.35; IWF < 0.10
  the Index Committee still chooses among eligible names (fixed count 500, sector balance);
  a member that later fails a criterion is not removed automatically.
