release 2026-02-03 Tue 07:00 ET (before the open): day 0 = 2026-02-03 Tue; that day's open usable? True
release 2026-02-04 Wed 12:30 ET (during the session): day 0 = 2026-02-04 Wed; that day's open usable? False
